From ed1de09f6bd108d32e21417dbe9ac1bea232d6d3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jakub Zelenka <bukka@php.net>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 15:29:19 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 17/26] Fix GHSA-mmf9-xm3v-hg2x: quadratic folded header
